    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just so busy with work and my husband is right that i've been super stressed. i really dont want to sit in an er for 8 hours just for something that is probably just a nerve issue. if i just take some high dose vitamin b complex and some steroids like i read online, can i just monitor it at home for a day or two to see if it goes away? seems way more logical than a hospital trip if nothing else is wrong.",
