      "content": "Taking steroids or high-dose vitamins at home without a diagnosis is dangerous because the specific treatment timing depends entirely on whether it is a stroke or Bell's palsy. A doctor must examine you to confirm the diagnosis before you can safely start any medication, as delaying care for a stroke can cause permanent damage. Please do not attempt to self-treat; your safety is more important than saving time on a busy day, and a quick triage visit at an urgent care center is the only logical next step.",
